    <item><title>怎麼辨識誇大的醫療宣稱？</title><link>https://deepgill1004-hue.github.io/feifei-yubai-site/letters/076-medical-claims-red-flags-20260809.html</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://deepgill1004-hue.github.io/feifei-yubai-site/letters/076-medical-claims-red-flags-20260809.html</guid><pubDate>Sun, 09 Aug 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><description><![CDATA[遇到永久、保證、一次見效與排毒等宣稱，先查核合法資格、核准用途、研究設計、風險與替代方案。]]></description><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>遇到永久、保證、一次見效與排毒等宣稱，先查核合法資格、核准用途、研究設計、風險與替代方案。</p><p><a href="https://deepgill1004-hue.github.io/feifei-yubai-site/letters/076-medical-claims-red-flags-20260809.html">閱讀完整文章</a></p>]]></content:encoded></item>
    <item><title>為什麼你需要健康管理顧問？</title><link>https://deepgill1004-hue.github.io/feifei-yubai-site/letters/075-health-management-advisor-role-20260808.html</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://deepgill1004-hue.github.io/feifei-yubai-site/letters/075-health-management-advisor-role-20260808.html</guid><pubDate>Sat, 08 Aug 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><description><![CDATA[好的健康管理協助你整理目標、紀錄與追蹤，但不越界診斷、開藥或取代醫師；先看角色邊界再決定是否需要。]]></description><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>好的健康管理協助你整理目標、紀錄與追蹤，但不越界診斷、開藥或取代醫師；先看角色邊界再決定是否需要。</p><p><a href="https://deepgill1004-hue.github.io/feifei-yubai-site/letters/075-health-management-advisor-role-20260808.html">閱讀完整文章</a></p>]]></content:encoded></item>
    <item><title>為什麼男性活力突然衰退？</title><link>https://deepgill1004-hue.github.io/feifei-yubai-site/letters/074-male-vitality-health-assessment-20260807.html</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://deepgill1004-hue.github.io/feifei-yubai-site/letters/074-male-vitality-health-assessment-20260807.html</guid><pubDate>Fri, 07 Aug 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><description><![CDATA[性功能或活力下降可能牽涉心血管、代謝、荷爾蒙、藥物與心理因素；別把複雜問題交給單一自費療程。]]></description><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>性功能或活力下降可能牽涉心血管、代謝、荷爾蒙、藥物與心理因素；別把複雜問題交給單一自費療程。</p><p><a href="https://deepgill1004-hue.github.io/feifei-yubai-site/letters/074-male-vitality-health-assessment-20260807.html">閱讀完整文章</a></p>]]></content:encoded></item>
    <item><title>怎麼讓醫美效果維持更久？</title><link>https://deepgill1004-hue.github.io/feifei-yubai-site/letters/073-aesthetic-results-recovery-management-20260806.html</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://deepgill1004-hue.github.io/feifei-yubai-site/letters/073-aesthetic-results-recovery-management-20260806.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 06 Aug 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><description><![CDATA[療程效果受技術、劑量、個人體質與術後照護共同影響；真正有效的做法，是照醫囑、防曬、睡眠與按時追蹤。]]></description><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>療程效果受技術、劑量、個人體質與術後照護共同影響；真正有效的做法，是照醫囑、防曬、睡眠與按時追蹤。</p><p><a href="https://deepgill1004-hue.github.io/feifei-yubai-site/letters/073-aesthetic-results-recovery-management-20260806.html">閱讀完整文章</a></p>]]></content:encoded></item>
    <item><title>打點滴真的比吃維他命好？</title><link>https://deepgill1004-hue.github.io/feifei-yubai-site/letters/072-iv-vitamin-therapy-evidence-20260805.html</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://deepgill1004-hue.github.io/feifei-yubai-site/letters/072-iv-vitamin-therapy-evidence-20260805.html</guid><pubDate>Wed, 05 Aug 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><description><![CDATA[靜脈注射能快速提高血中濃度，但高濃度不等於一般保健、美白或抗老效果更好；適應症與風險才是重點。]]></description><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>靜脈注射能快速提高血中濃度，但高濃度不等於一般保健、美白或抗老效果更好；適應症與風險才是重點。</p><p><a href="https://deepgill1004-hue.github.io/feifei-yubai-site/letters/072-iv-vitamin-therapy-evidence-20260805.html">閱讀完整文章</a></p>]]></content:encoded></item>
    <item><title>為什麼你的疲勞揮之不去？</title><link>https://deepgill1004-hue.github.io/feifei-yubai-site/letters/071-persistent-fatigue-systemic-health-20260804.html</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://deepgill1004-hue.github.io/feifei-yubai-site/letters/071-persistent-fatigue-systemic-health-20260804.html</guid><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 11:00:00 GMT</pubDate><description><![CDATA[持續疲勞不是單靠醫美或一種療程就能解決；先排除睡眠、貧血、甲狀腺、藥物與身心因素，再談介入。]]></description><content:encoded><![CDATA[<p>持續疲勞不是單靠醫美或一種療程就能解決；先排除睡眠、貧血、甲狀腺、藥物與身心因素，再談介入。</p><p><a href="https://deepgill1004-hue.github.io/feifei-yubai-site/letters/071-persistent-fatigue-systemic-health-20260804.html">閱讀完整文章</a></p>]]></content:encoded></item>
